      "notes": "Windows 11 Pro 25H2 on the x86-64 KVM box; nested virt (Hyper-V) works so WinNAT/exit-role is capable — New-NetNat + Get-NetNatSession proven live 2026-07-24 (impossible on the Apple-Silicon UTM guest). SSH user labadmin, password in the untracked secrets sidecar. Key-auth as labadmin VERIFIED; rustc/cargo 1.88.0 installed; MSVC Build Tools installed at C:\\BuildTools with link.exe confirmed resolving through VsDevCmd (2026-07-25) — the repo pins channel 1.88.0 against rustup's default host (msvc), and release ships msvc only, so msvc is required here rather than the gnu toolchain also present. NOTE: this guest does not answer ICMP (Windows Defender blocks inbound echo) — judge reachability by TCP/22 or virsh domain state, never ping. The active_exit / WinNAT cell run itself is still PENDING."
